      "name": "SleepWise&trade;",
      "description": {
        "content": "This resource allows partners to access their users' SleepWise&trade; data. All time values are UTC times. SleepWise&trade; data is calculated for [SleepWise&trade;](https://support.polar.com/en/polar-sleepwise) supported devices when minimum of 5 days of sleep data is available. SleepWise&trade; data consists of alertness periods and circadian bedtime periods.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
